+/**
+ * Comprehensive tests for TaskQueue.
+ *
+ * Covers all seven required behaviors:
+ *   1. enqueue preserves priority order (with FIFO tie-break)
+ *   2. maxConcurrency limits parallel execution
+ *   3. drain() resolves only after all tasks finish (and never synchronously)
